          <a href="#what-to-skip" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. What to Skip</a>
          <a href="#last-minute" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Last-Minute Gifts</a>
          <a href="#bundles" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Bundles Under $50</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Common Mistakes</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. FAQ</a>
        </nav>
