          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A budget gift works when it is the best version of something he already uses. A Lodge skillet, a Victorinox knife, a Black Diamond headlamp or a pair of Darn Tough socks will outlast almost anything else $50 can buy, and none of them look like a compromise.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pick from the world he spends his Saturdays in, pair small items into a kit, and add one line about why you chose it. For bigger budgets, start with our <a href="/best-christmas-gifts-for-men/">best Christmas gifts for men</a>.
          </p>
